nCOS ruling executed: verification-only per plan key /project/auger/foreman/plan/2026-11-26T11-50Z-tick-11-41-24", "capability_tags": [], "depends_on": [], "worker_status": "verified", "commit_hash": "3986b187cb2d3622db94f6e0ecfd6ac4eaccc3d3", "guard_result": "FAIL", "ci_result": "GREEN", "worktree": null, "branch": null, "worker_summary": "Verification-only close (premise check found fix already landed c8a416b + proof doc c461056, both on origin/main). Foreman re-ran the row's 4-arm AC probe live from /tmp on main: health 200 0.0044s warm, specs 200 count=12, block 200, namespaced check 200 3.09s bounded (jev_used=true, decided_by=score), control bare /check 404. Judge run 004065e3 (kimi lane) graded tip 3986b18: ALL FOUR criteria PASS, merge_recommendation no_concerns_found; overall=false ONLY on the tier-1 tests arm where test_a_broken_verb_fails_exactly_one_named_test red under 'AUGER_BLOCKED_BY: full-fleet sync push pid 2159775' — the exact ambient-leak class of open row AUG-210 (pid gone, env not present in foreman shell, re-gate queued). Attributing tier-1 red to AUG-210, not this row."}
 {"status": "complete", "id": "AUG-173", "title": "test_gate_mode.sh AUG-130 case is not hermetic to a docs-only HEAD: every docs-only commit reds CI (inner gate takes the doc-only fast path and exits 0)", "detail": {"fingerprint": "26cb40bec1f382f9b53116e241702409232f7b08368402482ad18d386728b967", "evidence": [{"run_id": "ed033c8f", "ts": "2026-11-16T00:51:29.343766+00:00"}]}, "priority": "P1", "source": null, "reasoning": "Measured this tick: A8 goal arm (goal A8: gate exits non-zero when a required arm did not run) is green in the main checkout (rc 0) but RED in a clean detached worktree whose HEAD c461056 is docs-only, because tests/gate.sh takes the doc-only fast path (git diff HEAD~1 HEAD is all docs) and skip_arm('pytest') is a non-required skip, so the gate exits 0 and the AUG-130 case's first assertion fires. Same lines appear in CI run 43771550165. Proven fix: adding GATE_FULL=1 to run_inner_gate's env makes the case pass (rc 0, AUG-130 skipped-arm policy: PASS) on that same docs-only tree.", "review_notes": null, "ts": null, "acceptance_criteria": "AC1 pre-fix falsifier reproduced: in a clean detached worktree at the docs-only commit c461056, `bash tests/test_gate_mode.sh` exits 1 and prints `AUG-130: gate exited 0 with its pytest arm NOT run`; the CI job for that commit (run 43771550165) fails the `run the gate (tests/gate.sh)` step with the same lines plus `GATE PASS / arms SKIPPED (not passed): pytest, wrapper-regression, e2e-smoke`.\nAC2 fix: `grep -c \"AUGER_GATE_INNER=1 GATE_FULL=1\" tests/test_gate_mode.sh` prints 1 — the AUG-130 inner probe forces the full gate, so the doc-only fast path cannot mask the required-skip policy.\nAC3 proof on a docs-only tree: in that same clean detached worktree at c461056 with only this fix applied, `bash tests/test_gate_mode.sh` exits 0 and its output contains `AUG-130 skipped-arm policy: PASS`.\nAC4 no weakening: `grep -c \"env -u AUGER_ALLOW_SKIPPED_ARMS\" tests/test_gate_mode.sh` prints 1, `grep -c \"GATE PASS (